    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Hypergravitas bicephalis.</em> A two-headed gravity-warping aberration that drinks light (AC 18 in Bright Light thanks to its Distortion Armour's Three-Quarters Cover), drags everything into its well, and switches gravity off entirely before slamming it back on. Habitat: Hill &amp; Mountain.</p><p><em>Source: @UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.field-notes-library.JournalEntry.lP7Kf1tHLx3GJj0e]{Heliana's Field Notes X-22 (Loot Tavern)}</em></p>",
